[{"client_msg_id":"8e67778f-cf67-4254-8efe-184f614b5974","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"t_8u の設定を教えてもらったので、256色の環境でも set cursorline  にアンダーラインが付いた。","ts":"1629189979.466100","thread_ts":"1629180950.462800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HoIp"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"140e4617-2d04-48c8-b22e-d7116f320131","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"最近は t_8u も加わって、下線も true color で表示できるようになっています。","ts":"1629180950.462800","thread_ts":"1629180950.462800","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yMS1"}]}},{"type":"message","text":"\u003chttps://teratail.com/questions/354780?rss=all|SSHのconfig設定でvim編集後の終わり方\u003e\nSSHをGithubに設定するために、\nGitHubにssh接続できるようにするという記事の内容に従って上から順に行いました。\n「公開鍵をGitHubに登録する」までは問題なかったのですが、「config設定」でつまづいてしまいました。\n具体的には、記事の通り、下記をターミナルに入力し、configファイルを編集できるようになったのですが、  \nvim ~/.ssh/config\n\n編集後、ターミナルのどこを触っても入力することができなくなってしまいました。  \nvim編集を終わらせる「wq」などのコマンドがあるようなのですが、入力できない状況では、使うことが...\n\n\u003chttps://teratail.com/questions/354780?rss=all|続きを見る\u003e","ts":"1629184850.465200","attachments":[{"fallback":"teratail[テラテイル]: SSHのconfig設定でvim編集後の終わり方｜teratail","id":1,"title":"SSHのconfig設定でvim編集後の終わり方｜teratail","title_link":"https://teratail.com/questions/354780?rss=all","text":"SSHをGithubに設定するために、GitHubにssh接続できるようにするという記事の内容に従って上から順に行いました。「公開鍵をGitHubに登録する」までは問題なかったのですが、「config設定」でつまづいてしまいました。具体的には、記事の通り、下記をターミナルに入力し、configファイ","thumb_url":"https://teratail.com/img/imgFacebookShare.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"teratail[テラテイル]","service_icon":"https://teratail.com/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon-72x72-precomposed.png","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"https://teratail.com/questions/354780?rss=all","original_url":"https://teratail.com/questions/354780?rss=all"}],"edited":{"user":"BPV6T0C1J","ts":"1629184855.000000"},"subtype":"bot_message","bot_id":"BPV6T0C1J","username":"[Vim]の新着質問一覧｜teratail（テラテイル）","icons":{"image_48":"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/slack-files2/bot_icons/2019-10-29/814941997319_48.png"},"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"bef79dec-2de0-4df3-8adc-1674a12ec36f","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ああ、なるほど。\nvim は自前の termcap (builtin termcap) を持っていて、`$TERM` が xterm 互換だと、xterm 用の builtin termcap がロードされる。そしてその中に `t_8b` なども含まれている。\nbuiltin termcap をロードしたあと、`tgetstr()` を使ってシステムの termcap から追加の設定を読み込む。\n`$TERM` が tmux などだと、システムの termcap から設定を読み込んでおしまい。なので `t_8b` 等が設定されない。","ts":"1629183652.464800","thread_ts":"1629180877.461800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MEGZ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"61cfb985-0798-4d75-88ae-056adf4b52d4","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"（どこで判別してるんだっけと term.c を見てたけど、よく分からなかった）","ts":"1629180877.461800","thread_ts":"1629180877.461800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5a8h"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"45210850-d74e-4db8-86d7-1cca332781b3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ヘルプ翻訳してて、そこ見ました。\n下線フルカラーってw、みたいに思いましたけど、必要は必要ですしね","ts":"1629181062.463800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l3+i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"140e4617-2d04-48c8-b22e-d7116f320131","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"最近は t_8u も加わって、下線も true color で表示できるようになっています。","ts":"1629180950.462800","thread_ts":"1629180950.462800","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","UG6DF6W87","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yMS1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61cfb985-0798-4d75-88ae-056adf4b52d4","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"（どこで判別してるんだっけと term.c を見てたけど、よく分からなかった）","ts":"1629180877.461800","thread_ts":"1629180877.461800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5a8h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3024e3a5-401e-49fd-9126-72c58d6bb9ea","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`$TERM` が xterm-256color なら t_8b, t_8f, t_8u が自動設定されますが、それ以外だとされませんので、.vimrc で設定する必要があります。","ts":"1629180834.460800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6HC1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f8146f3-e7d0-4108-a54c-16c150489c4e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あるとしたらそのへんですかね","ts":"1629180659.458900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z4O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53a635ca-258a-452c-80fd-83f4b03393fe","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"あ、\n\n\u0026gt; あとは vim が xterm 以外のときに t_8b t_8f を設定してくれないので、vimrc で手動でしてやるとよいです\n\nこれのことか。","ts":"1629180649.458600","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1629180665.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JtL3C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e394f7d4-25c1-4701-a656-4ff9b9561559","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"vim でtermguicolorsを設定すると、白黒になってしまうのは、なんでだろう。...","ts":"1629180583.457800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jJl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5d84e84-af0c-41a9-a78f-a4591c070dfc","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"tmux に terminal-overrides を書いて Tc なエスケープシーケンスを tmux の外に投げれるように設定して、あとは vim が xterm 以外のときに t_8b t_8f を設定してくれないので、vimrc で手動でしてやるとよいです","ts":"1629180488.456900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ts2W5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"224428cf-d455-406f-9ce5-d106c4ff5648","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"tmux の default-terminal 自体は screen-256color でも大丈夫です\n// 私はたしかそうしてる","ts":"1629180360.453600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GYov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8265c523-d845-4ea2-b693-3c7cfea9e500","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"うーん。修行が足りてないので把握できてないな。screen-256colorでもええんかいな。","ts":"1629180300.452100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Q9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5830cfc9-46d8-4244-ab95-5e6ead0c5402","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"これですかね\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/slacklog/CNX3F8RFC/2021/07/#ts-1625138294.002000\u003e","ts":"1629179832.450400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/BON"}]},{"client_msg_id":"439be58c-1ed7-4df5-a839-c551e40199a0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"xterm-256color 自体にはないのかもしれない? \u0026gt; Tc フラグ\nそういや、こないだどなたかが true color な terminfo を生成するとよいよって話をされてた気がする","ts":"1629179676.450100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fig"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cf40f2f-c692-4ff0-ad2d-92efb3a9f97c","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"だからtermguicolorsがうまく動くのか。","ts":"1629178883.447900","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1629179016.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3HO15"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0761bcd-971b-4f21-abfe-ba313bf7c6ea","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"生uxterm だと、\n```echo $TERM\nxterm-256color```","ts":"1629178875.447600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ec/ss"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30d18165-1879-47e2-8d17-a49da1a0f513","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"だから、vimが256colorにならないのか。","ts":"1629178803.446900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2YPJn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3afe30a3-6fdb-42f8-9bd5-bdcc13f0b906","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"```echo $TERM\nscreen-256color```","ts":"1629178784.446300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M/xaS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85b5a3e1-7800-4395-81d6-68b4fe381a21","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"むむ。もしかして byobu-tmux が","ts":"1629178761.445800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RG5I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b5b444c-069e-4c1d-9ab6-8fa5152e9ed6","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/yami_beta/items/ef535d3458addd2e8fbb#comment-66e314b5f7d7d746d6b3\u003e\n\u0026gt; terminal-overridesはtmuxの外側の端末の挙動を修正する設定なので、tmuxの外側(起動前)がxterm-256colorの場合は set terminal-overrides -ga \",xterm-256color:Tc\" とする必要があります。\n\u0026gt; 上記の設定は、外側のTERMがxterm-256colorの時フルカラーフラグ(Tc)を立てるという意味になります。\nterminfo には true color 対応かどうかの情報はないのかな？","ts":"1629178078.444800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: tmux 上で Vim を True Color (24 bit color) で使う - Qiita","id":1,"title":"tmux 上で Vim を True Color (24 bit color) で使う - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/yami_beta/items/ef535d3458addd2e8fbb#comment-66e314b5f7d7d746d6b3","text":"Vim には、termguicolors というオプションがあり、端末上でも True Color を使用することが出来ます。 set termguicolors tmux 上で Vim を使う場合 tmux で True ...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-dGV4dD9peGxpYj1yYi00LjAuMCZ3PTg0MCZoPTUwMCZ0eHQ2ND1RSGxoYldsZlltVjBZUSZ0eHQtY29sb3I9JTIzMzMzJnR4dC1mb250PUhpcmFnaW5vJTIwU2FucyUyMFc2JnR4dC1zaXplPTQ1JnR4dC1hbGlnbj1yaWdodCUyQ2JvdHRvbSZzPWNkNzI4MDYyYTcwMzcyMzdlY2UzNjFkNGZkNDk2NGYw\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=478a00481f3a83fdf42a01e8595ec14b","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/yami_beta/items/ef535d3458addd2e8fbb#comment-66e314b5f7d7d746d6b3","original_url":"https://qiita.com/yami_beta/items/ef535d3458addd2e8fbb#comment-66e314b5f7d7d746d6b3"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"phHw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cadeabc2-d631-42e1-8493-cf72b3b976a2","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"TERM alacritty で私が困ったのは SSH 先で tmux 使ったときですね\nless とか叩いたときに完全な端末じゃないぞ!って怒られるようになった","ts":"1629177449.443300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ALh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4882b191-1c08-4840-8e44-1caca36b75ea","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"tmux は strict に terminfo に従うから terminal-overrides が必要なのかな多分、しらんけど","ts":"1629177341.441000","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1629177359.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lfT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b307f463-04a9-4101-a90d-81a0097fccda","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"• アプリが tmux の中の `$TERM` の設定にしたがってescシーケンスを送出\n• tmux が（内部的に）画面を構築\n• 構築された画面を表示するため、外の `$TERM` の設定にしたがってescシーケンスを送出\n• 端末エミュレーターが画面を描画\nみたいな動作のはず。知らんけど","ts":"1629176227.438200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xTK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58fade98-7fff-4c85-b9a0-b2c1daff392f","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"tmuxはそれ自体が端末エミュレーターなので、tmuxの中の `$TERM` と外の `$TERM` がそれぞれ正しく設定されてないといかんですよね。","ts":"1629175657.436400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rm+Ul"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1228822-2787-4168-877f-a282cb011243","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"となると余計な設定の要らない分、TERM:alacrittyの方が設定を書く上では優れてたってことになりそうですね\n色々と知見が得られた","ts":"1629174694.434500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TRqNk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"088c7f13-1a9b-4213-8f5a-2503d92d432a","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"なんならt_8fとかt_8bとかも要らないですね","ts":"1629174560.433000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Z3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92d01270-f600-46fd-a165-006c3b194e52","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、デフォでよかったんですね\nそういや、そんなこと help に書いてた気がしますね","ts":"1629174528.432500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVdI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc72e6fe-6b57-4d6d-ad6a-41ea8e074d2d","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"overridesを,alacritty:Tcにするだけでよさそうでした","ts":"1629174506.431900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9rfy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35e63334-9ff8-42e3-b2aa-6cb182bbc0ec","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"結論から言うと、うまくいきました\nvimrcの設定を変える必要はなかったようです","ts":"1629174454.430500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pwg2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60a75fff-5a8a-4d12-8f30-6aaf8301d75f","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"あ、置き換わりましたね　ってことはさっきのalacrittyのtmux検証は不十分だったのでやり直しです","ts":"1629174215.429800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["US90LD360","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z2Lo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0dd783a-5ba3-441c-b6c8-64c5352ee19a","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"なるほど？やってみます","ts":"1629174161.429200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bkrA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6302335b-a56c-4d88-978e-de5544441d9a","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"`tmux source ~/.tmux.conf` ?","ts":"1629174119.428400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oau"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b62dc754-f862-484f-b576-5dfb6500e5b9","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"私は tmux 全部落とす以外の再反映したことないのでよくわからんですね...","ts":"1629174113.428000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ow4du"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1b4e150-c12e-4257-85ed-2cedff64006b","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"それがどうも置き換わらないんですが…もしかして新しいセッションを開始するだけじゃ不十分で、デタッチしてるセッションも終了しないと.tmux.confの設定は反映されないとか？","ts":"1629174044.426400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vTb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"165cff61-04f8-4fc9-87cb-b31da00bf566","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"default-terminal は tmux 起動すると置き換わる、はず","ts":"1629173934.423100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4JmgS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75e3aedd-f7a8-4a57-8953-d48777f42906","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"表の TERM と裏の TERM があってな、と認識してます","ts":"1629173852.421600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r/GM="}]},{"client_msg_id":"af51d1fd-11b9-4b56-b891-986105c012f6","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"WSL2の方はdefault-terminalが普通に機能してる（TERM書き換わる）から余計に混乱する","ts":"1629173819.420500","edited":{"user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1629173836.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5UaG7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63a5bd51-2d39-4cab-988f-c4e5613b609e","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"tmux側といえば、本当に動いてるのか怪しい感じでしたね\ndefault-terminalとかoverridesと言いつつもTERMを書き換えるわけではないのかな","ts":"1629173782.420000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8kqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01e70895-ed65-499e-a43b-72ec45e1e575","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"色出るには出るんですが、文字だけで背景がおかしいって感じになりましたね","ts":"1629173659.419100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8mv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaf57a35-8243-46fe-8b8d-14e546ce6d54","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"alacrittyのデフォルトだと色すら出なかったな、うちの環境だと","ts":"1629173624.418700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lp8wq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e14837d-4832-4c43-badf-1b95b4e0a3ae","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あとは tmux 側でどーにか合わせれば alacritty のままで動くかなーって思ったけどダメでした、ってのが terminal-overrides の話","ts":"1629173597.418000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mdj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"096b52b1-8276-4380-b9fc-3cdda18eb2cf","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"TERM:alacrittyは捨てようと強く心に刻まれた","ts":"1629173591.417800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WuVU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1300a5af-ad8c-43d7-a023-7b7218a28ed7","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"xterm はセミコロン区切りだけど、alacritty はコロン区切りだったらしい","ts":"1629173549.415900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qX+EO"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *xterm-true-color*\nVimは端末がサポートするならば、トゥルーカラーを使うこと (|highlight-guifg| 及\nび |highlight-guibg| を流用する) をサポートします。これを機能させるには\n'termguicolors' オプションをセットする必要があります。\nトゥルーカラーをサポートする端末の一覧については\n\u003chttps://gist.github.com/XVilka/8346728\u003e を参照してください。\n \n場合によっては 'termguicolors' を設定するだけでは不十分で、|t_8f| と |t_8b| オ\nプションを明示的に設定しなければならないことがあります。これらのオプションのデ\nフォルトはそれぞれ \"^[[38;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\" と \"^[[48;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\" で、\n`$TERM` が `xterm` の時にだけ設定されます。幾つかの端末は同じシーケンスを受け\n付けますが、全てのセミコロンをコロンで置き換える必要があります (実際にはコチラ\nのほうが互換性の高い方法ですが、広くはサポートされていません):  \n         let \u0026amp;t_8f = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[38:2:%lu:%lu:%lum\"\n         let \u0026amp;t_8b = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[48:2:%lu:%lu:%lum\"\n \nこれらのオプションは printf 用の文字列を含んでおり、|printf()| (実際には `l`\nmodifier ゆえに C 言語のものと同等) により t_ オプションの値と、赤、青、緑を表\n現する 0 から 255 の 3 つの符号なし長整数の値が組み合わされます。\n```","ts":"1629173514.415000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b895207b-47c2-4b20-979f-de4756c4b4f6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ちなみにコロンにかえる云々の話は\n:h xterm-true-color にあります","ts":"1629173514.414900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OKzk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baf1262b-d836-4e9f-8e22-dc07e8c292a6","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"ありがとうございました！","ts":"1629173365.413600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2C=9k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"317da150-b333-4e00-aa6d-2cc8a4b60b2b","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"とりあえずalacritty.ymlのTERMをxterm-256colorにすると万事がうまくいってしまったので、それで行こうと思います\n下手にalacrittyに変えて、漢字でこうなることにしばらく気づけなかったんだな","ts":"1629173351.413300","edited":{"user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1629173360.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xIfH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c133b19-ce8a-4bfc-abc2-c85389d29ab6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ふむ、そこはダメなのか","ts":"1629172987.411600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fDwO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8846f972-2d0b-4f83-8211-37c84cff20d7","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"色が若干おかしいままです","ts":"1629172975.411100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9mLZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff0b9fad-bec0-4e79-93cd-d3972b69c804","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ですです","ts":"1629172966.410800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AAF3z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fae7dcde-6476-4b67-8330-1136b865b930","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"\",alacritty:Tc\" ということですよね","ts":"1629172961.410600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftLn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2520060b-35af-4de6-b530-aca8961c5284","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"alacritty-256color ではない","ts":"1629172907.410000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nNEhT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cb6cf70-7a94-4cd8-b811-6739c707ccbb","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、xterm-256color を alacritty に変更っていみです","ts":"1629172895.409600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df4aea51-5f1d-42b9-89a8-10bc7e56ab7d","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ふむふむ、その状態で\nterminal-overrides の xterm のとこを alacritty って書くとどうなります?","ts":"1629172867.409000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pjTAZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df654479-8b85-4748-a7b5-6f6c35f96392","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"描画されない問題は解消されましたが、tmux時だけは色が若干おかしいですね","ts":"1629172818.407700","edited":{"user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1629172828.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eUzK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdac2d00-d2ac-4297-8d88-1f8b5d04b9b1","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"やってみます","ts":"1629172687.406900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7=n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cbf8417-1d87-4bce-a29f-93f0ea202293","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ちなみに TERM alacritty で、\nt_8f/t_8b のセミコロンを全部コロンに書き換えるとどうなります?","ts":"1629172668.406500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"clY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa04c3d9-5419-45a8-87a4-6b460881b253","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"TERM alacritty はデフォだけど、まともに動いたことない...\nとはいえ途切れるみたいなのは見たことないですが...","ts":"1629172531.403700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wKLB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2c8e270-cf56-4ecb-a8d7-577569263f06","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"あ、直った　これかあ","ts":"1629172488.402300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vqyWq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a93edee-1768-46b4-bec4-208c6f25996c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"明示しても変わらずです?","ts":"1629172467.401900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aEw3h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52a3e208-d61e-42c5-a8e7-2101244e9afb","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"あーありますね　そこで明示しています","ts":"1629172412.401500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QUK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"044c6cb2-6069-41a8-965b-16a9f9e4ee3a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"env フィールドだったかな","ts":"1629172398.401200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=VC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78d39fdf-11f6-4379-92fb-c739b00f6e08","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"alacritty.yml で TERM 設定します","ts":"1629172384.400800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NnMg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c21d55f-4fcf-470f-8af7-de19c539c7b8","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"TERM alacritty なら terminal-overrides 効かないのはそらそうってやつですね","ts":"1629172360.400000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vz2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4eb77f52-f69d-4e92-a07e-30bfeb5b250d","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"単純にTERMを書き換えれば良いですか？","ts":"1629172343.399400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EkE7y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e1bf463-c64e-4d97-9d6d-02a112da6fd0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"検証する意味ないかな","ts":"1629172101.395600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xj=B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3c72441-1b25-43f5-9045-894e070b3627","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"tmux が無い時に TERM を xterm-256color にしたらどうなります？","ts":"1629172082.395300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FGZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6b88554-d242-44c1-b23e-d4945c5e6c6f","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"tmuxのないときはTERMはalacrittyで、やはり漢字で上記の描画されない問題が発生しますね","ts":"1629171911.394700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"80JH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d4eaefc-f872-4fb1-ba8f-8f16c65048d0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ん、tmux 抜いたときは状況変わりますか?","ts":"1629171705.394100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kmRE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"104d706b-be78-47f0-a3a5-ba7e39930953","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"TERMはtmux-256colorですね\nvimの設定に合わせて\n```set -g default-terminal \"screen-256color\"\nset-option -ga terminal-overrides \",xterm-256color:Tc\"```\nと.tmux.confに書いたりはしてるんですが反映はされてなさそう","ts":"1629171008.393400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IIWs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b33aef12-2764-4ea3-9067-5c08d824deaf","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"その設定値自体は 24bit color のエスケープシーケンスの形を指定するやつですね\n$TERM の中身が気になります","ts":"1629161446.391300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sWxJp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b143b2e7-d3f3-4f46-af03-4929acd88c68","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1629158469.388800","files":[{"id":"F02BD14RL3C","created":1629158462,"timestamp":1629158462,"name":"PXL_20210816_235224189.PORTRAIT.jpg","title":"PXL_20210816_235224189.PORTRAIT.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"UFBGUPDP0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":613492,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BD14RL3C/pxl_20210816_235224189.portrait.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BD14RL3C/download/pxl_20210816_235224189.portrait.jpg","original