KKKKACiiigAooooA/9k=","username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gYTj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba22118f-666e-474d-ac73-af56101cd38c","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"妙な現象に悩まされているので相談させてください\nvimrc抜粋\n```let \u0026amp;t_8f = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[38;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\"\nlet \u0026amp;t_8b = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[48;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\"```\nこの行が厳密になんだったかはコメントもなくて忘れちゃったんですが、Linux環境においてカラースキームが機能しなかったから調べて置いた覚えがあって\nこれはMac環境においても、ちょっとだけ色がおかしくなるけど大体機能していました\nしかし最近になって、Macで漢字コメントが有る場合描画が途中から無くなる（文字通り無くなる)現象が起こるようになり、その現象はこの行を消すと直るという状況になりました（色関連設定なので、消すと当然色はなくなりますが\nWindowsのWSL2環境においては再現しません。\nちょっと直接端末画像を出せないので、描画がなくなった画面の写真を添付します","ts":"1629158434.388700","edited":{"user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1629158568.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oioUm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d1ecb80-dea8-4bd9-a099-cc6044e7f814","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"メモった","ts":"1629128220.383600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"drpkH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56fbc4a5-85e5-4b81-a423-4e37170d5e71","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://scrapbox.io/skanehira/Vim_script_Tips\u003e","ts":"1629128219.383400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qgz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3ca826b-15bf-4bb4-b84a-2bd61ec9ac67","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1629127986.383200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cHWVF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f8bdfa5-f0ce-4acb-a8a9-b15aab16af75","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"新しい機能であるかもですが...たぶん無いだろうなぁ....","ts":"1629127097.382800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ytaH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d2cad81-c9e0-4307-9221-0e992912aa56","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"了解です！","ts":"1629127079.382400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K8ke"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db2e8bbd-da78-4e9a-9eac-3c1aed9735ac","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ですよねー、実はスマートな別解でもあるかと思ったけどないかー","ts":"1629127051.381700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kMnPW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4abe952e-2cf0-4971-bd7d-03d8156ef8f0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"それ以外の実用的な方法はない気がします","ts":"1629127030.381300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U69"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e8cca31-25b3-4247-a70f-7622b7fe5406","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"やっぱそれ安定なのか","ts":"1629127008.380800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ivjD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39ddd82d-ef42-4675-883c-a7d65f73efbc","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"関数の*外*で\n\n```let s:script = expand('\u0026lt;sfile\u0026gt;')```\nと定義しておくのが定石ですね","ts":"1629126989.380500","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1629127001.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Re1f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c65d111-28be-4c1f-ad06-b569b613fe40","type":"message","user":"U01R5R36QK0","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/omochicemgr/status/1427275619004391427\u003e\nvimscriptで呼び出してる関数が書いてるファイルのパスを取る方法ってありますか？","ts":"1629126883.379600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/omochicemgr|@omochicemgr\u003e: function hogeが~/foo/bar/hoge.vimに書いてるとして、call hoge()の中から~/foo/bar/hoge.vimを得る方法","id":1,"author_name":"ももも","author_subname":"@omochicemgr","author_link":"https://twitter.com/omochicemgr/status/1427275619004391427","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1412425250185306117/bqgUPzlj_normal.png","text":"function hogeが~/foo/bar/hoge.vimに書いてるとして、call hoge()の中から~/foo/bar/hoge.vimを得る方法","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1629123999,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/omochicemgr/status/1427275619004391427","original_url":"https://twitter.com/omochicemgr/status/1427275619004391427"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9qR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70931c01-7596-41d8-941a-7d74c5442c55","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"underline の設定をしようかと思ったのですが、256色用のエスケープシーケンスをどうやって設定していいのか。単体で設定するのではなく、組み合わせるのでしょうか。","ts":"1629185568.465400","thread_ts":"1629180950.462800","parent_user_id":"U6XP9LZ6V","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n5/hU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02281674-2d92-4f8d-b606-5eb78c787514","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"自分で設定する場合は、t_8b, t_8f と同じような感じで `let \u0026amp;t_8u = \"\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;[58;2;%lu;%lu;%lum\"` となります。（シンタックス側の対応も必要ですが）","ts":"1629186460.465700","thread_ts":"1629180950.462800","parent_user_id":"U6XP9LZ6V","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FgAkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c41b5394-8b32-4568-8256-afeceab79058","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ありがとうございます。","ts":"1629188111.465900","thread_ts":"1629180950.462800","parent_user_id":"U6XP9LZ6V","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hbwl"}]}]
